gstreamer1.0-rockchip (1.14-4+rkr7.20250804.0eb19f9) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Built from mixtile-sdk-linux-gstreamer-rockchip
    0eb19f99a4cf8c1d07042d542f7785e73aaeb7a2, the linux-6.1-stan-rkr7 branch
    of Mixtile's mirror of the Rockchip SDK.
  * The tree carries its own debian/ and is built from it unchanged; this
    changelog is the only file laid over it. Its rules enables rkximage,
    rockchipmpp, kmssrc and rga; vpxalphadec is left at upstream's default of
    off, being a software decoder with no Rockchip hardware behind it.
  * 1.14 is the version upstream's own changelog carries, last touched in
    2021; the source has moved on considerably since, which is what the rkr7
    baseline and the commit in the version record.

